{"unit_id":"AIcivilization__dsh-vps#card-zh","repo":"AIcivilization/dsh-vps","commit":"d4223e07717dce3832d0233a6a12edfceb3fde27","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vps 是一款 DSH 网页客户端插件和 VPS 部署工具，可把 DSH 安装到自己的服务器，并通过登录网关和 HTTPS 从浏览器远程访问。插件在「设置 → VPS 部署」提供服务器安装与卸载表单、网关状态、域名和密码管理、手机桌面访问二维码及 DSH 版本升级入口；服务器安装由 SSH 启动，另可直接运行一键安装命令。适合希望在自有 VPS 上持续使用 DSH 的个人或团队。需要服务器 SSH 登录权限；服务器部署需 root 或 sudo，并由安装器配置 DSH、Caddy 和 systemd。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:25-47","plugin/client.js:2610-2645","plugin/remote-install.mjs:211-277","install.sh:40-58"]}
{"unit_id":"AIcivilization__dsh-vps#card-en","repo":"AIcivilization/dsh-vps","commit":"d4223e07717dce3832d0233a6a12edfceb3fde27","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vps deploys DSH on your VPS behind a login gateway and HTTPS. Its DSH settings page supports SSH installation and removal, gateway status, domain and password controls, a phone access QR code, and DSH upgrades. Server deployment needs SSH access and root or sudo.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin/index.mjs:25-47","plugin/client.js:2610-2645","plugin/remote-install.mjs:211-277","install.sh:40-58"]}
